{
  "dom_id": "step-t7866",
  "name": "Further Interpreting Multiplication of Fractions and Whole Numbers",
  "problem": "Consider the expression $\\dfrac{5}{\\color{red}3} \\times {\\color{blue}12}.$ By expressing the fraction as division, we have\n\n$$\n5 {\\color{red}\\;\\div\\; 3} {\\color{blue}\\;\\times\\; 12},\n$$\n\nand by swapping the ${\\color{red}\\div\\; 3}$ and the ${\\color{blue}\\times\\; 12},$ we have\n\n$$\n5 {\\color{blue}\\;\\times\\; 12}{\\color{red}\\;\\div\\; 3}.\n$$\n\nNow, notice that we can rewrite the division ${\\color{blue}12} {\\color{red}\\;\\div\\; 3}$ as a new fraction $\\dfrac{\\color{blue}12}{\\color{red}3}$ to produce a new expression:\n\n$$\n5\\times \\dfrac{\\color{blue}12}{\\color{red}3}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\dfrac{5}{\\color{red}3} \\times {\\color{blue}12} = 5\\times \\dfrac{\\color{blue}12}{\\color{red}3}.\n$$",
  "worked_solution": "",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-t7866\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n               \n                <div class=\"tutorial\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Further Interpreting Multiplication of Fractions and Whole Numbers</span></div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"t7866\">?</div>\n                    </div>                    \n    \n                    <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage * {\n                            transition: none;\n      